#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "The port, IP and 802.1x tables are being repartitioned, or a rebuild did not finish, so their history cannot be changed now. Try again when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php has finished."
msgstr "Efa ao anatin'ny fanavaozana ny fizarazarana ny tabilaon'ny seranana, IP ary 802.1x, na tsy vita ny fanamboarana indray, ka tsy azo ovaina izao ny tantaran'izy ireo. Andramo indray rehefa vita ny cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "MacTrack is in maintenance mode for IP address, MAC address and 802.1x searching while its history tables are repartitioned. Results are incomplete until the partitioning has finished."
msgstr "Ao amin'ny fomba fikojakojana ny MacTrack ho an'ny fikarohana adiresy IP, adiresy MAC ary 802.1x mandritra ny fizarana indray ny tabilao tantarany. Tsy feno ny vokatra mandra-pahavitan'ny fizarana."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "MacTrack is in maintenance mode for IP address, MAC address and 802.1x searching because the partitioning of its history tables did not finish. Results are incomplete. Run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php again to resume it."
msgstr "Ao amin'ny fomba fikojakojana ny MacTrack ho an'ny fikarohana adiresy IP, adiresy MAC ary 802.1x satria tsy vita ny fizarana ny tabilao tantarany. Tsy feno ny vokatra. Alefaso indray ny cli/upgrade_partitioning.php mba hanohizana izany."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "Maintenance Mode"
msgstr "Fomba fikojakojana"

