#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Database Administration"
msgstr "Fitantanana angon-drakitra"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes expired Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Only records that have expired, based upon your criteria are removed."
msgstr "Mamafa ny fifandraisana Port amin'ny MAC sy IP lany daty ao amin'ny tahiry angona.  Ny firaketana lany daty ihany, araka ny fepetranao, no esorina."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Refresh IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI Database"
msgstr "Havaozy ny angon-drakitra MAC/OUI an'ny mpamatsy IEEE"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "This function will download and install the latest OIU database from the IEEE Website.  Each Network Interface Card (NIC) has a MAC Address.  The MAC Address can be broken into two parts.  The first part of the MAC Address contains the Vendor MAC.  The Vendor MAC identifies who manufactured the part.  This will be helpful in spot checking for rogue devices on your network."
msgstr "Ity fiasa ity dia hisintona sy hametraka ny tahirin-kevitra OIU farany indrindra avy amin'ny tranonkalan'ny IEEE. Ny Karatra Tambajotra (NIC) tsirairay dia manana Adiresy MAC. Azo zaraina roa ny Adiresy MAC. Ny ampahany voalohany amin'ny Adiresy MAC dia ahitana ny MAC Mpamatsy. Ny MAC Mpamatsy dia mamaritra hoe iza no nanamboatra ilay fitaovana. Hanampy amin'ny fijerena tampoka ny fitaovana tsy nahazoana alalana ao amin'ny tambajotranao izany."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes old and potentially stale Mactrack scanning functions from the drop-down you receive when you edit a device type."
msgstr "Mamafa ireo asa fitarafana Mactrack taloha sy mety ho efa lany andro ao amin'ny lisitra midina azo rehefa manova karazana fitaovana ianao."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes <strong>ALL</strong> Port to MAC to IP associations from the database all IP Addresses, IP Ranges, and VLANS.  This utility is good when you want to start over.  <strong>DANGER: All prior data is deleted.</strong>"
msgstr "Mamafa ny fifandraisana Port amin'ny MAC sy IP <strong>REHETRA</strong> ao amin'ny tahiry angona, ny adiresy IP rehetra, ny elanelana IP ary ny VLAN.  Ity fitaovana ity dia tsara rehefa te hanomboka vaovao ianao.  <strong>LOZA: Voafafa daholo ny angona taloha rehetra.</strong>"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds the list of scan dates from the stored Port to MAC to IP results, reading each partition once. Scans and maintenance keep the list current, so this is only needed after results were removed outside of maintenance, for example by deleting devices."
msgstr "Manamboatra indray ny lisitry ny datin'ny fitiliana avy amin'ny vokatry ny Seranana mankany amin'ny MAC mankany amin'ny IP voatahiry, mamaky indray mandeha ny fizarana tsirairay. Ny fitiliana sy ny fikojakojana dia mitazona ny lisitra ho havaozina hatrany, ka tsy ilaina izany raha tsy efa nesorina ivelan'ny fikojakojana ny vokatra, ohatra amin'ny famafana fitaovana."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "View Partition Status"
msgstr "Jereo ny Satan'ny fizarazarana"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Shows how the Port to MAC to IP results are partitioned, the partition size in use and why, and what the last database maintenance did."
msgstr "Mampiseho ny fomba fizarazarana ny valin'ny Port mankany amin'ny MAC mankany amin'ny IP, ny haben'ny fizarana ampiasaina sy ny antony, ary izay nataon'ny fikojakojana ny angon-drakitra farany."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds and analyzes only the partition containing the latest port observation to reclaim deleted space; with weekly partitions that is the current week. Unpartitioned tables are optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped until it finishes."
msgstr "Manamboatra indray sy manadihady ny fizarana mirakitra ny fandinihana seranana farany ihany mba hahazoana indray ny habaka voafafa; miaraka amin'ny fizarana isan-kerinandro dia izao herinandro izao izany. Ny tabilao tsy voazara dia amboarina manontolo. Avela ny fitiliana voalahatra mandra-pahavitany."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Choose daily or weekly partitions, or disable partitioning, for the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables. The rebuild copies the full history in the background; scheduled scans are skipped and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message meanwhile."
msgstr "Safidio ny fizarazaran-tabilao isan'andro na isan-kerinandro, na foano ny fizarazaran-tabilao, ho an'ny tabilaon'ny seranana (adiresy MAC), adiresy IP ary 802.1x. Ny fanorenana indray dia mandika ny tantara manontolo any ambadika; lalovana ny fitarafana voalahatra ary mampiseho hafatra fikojakojana ny fikarohana MAC, IP ary 802.1x mandritra izany."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Aggregated Table Administration"
